SFD-Lite research-code release

This distribution contains a modified source snapshot of Ultralytics 8.4.60.
Ultralytics source files retain their original copyright and AGPL-3.0 notices.
The upstream project is available at https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics.

SFD-Lite-specific additions include the SA-SPD-Lite and SF-DCA-Lite modules,
canonical model configurations, the DyNWD regression branch, and reproducibility
gate scripts. The entire combined distribution is provided under AGPL-3.0.

Datasets, trained model weights, experiment outputs, and manuscript files are
not included in this repository.
